  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-led Climate Resilience and Conservation in East Malaita 2024 to 2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports community-led climate resilience and conservation activities in East Malaita, Solomon Islands, in partnership with the Baru Conservation Alliance and James Cook University. This partnership leads the Moo&#x2019;u program, a locally-led community stewardship model that covers mitigation, adaptation, preservation of traditional knowledge, protection and management of native biodiversity, community health and education. The Moo&#x2019;u Program is also contributing to the attainment of protected area status of virgin forests in East Malaita.</narrative>
  </description>
